BT 1 0 0 1 0 43 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (The setting is the fictional Asterion Institute for Clinical Systems, a research centre developing software to identify) Tj T* (patterns in patient-monitoring data. At 9:50 p.m. on a stormy Thursday, research director Dr. Adrian John is found) Tj T* (dead in the sealed Archive Room. The next morning, he was due to present evidence that the institute\222s celebrated) Tj T* (Project LANTERN study had been manipulated.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 62.69291 651.7008 cm
q
.133333 .133333 .133333 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 43 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (Dr. John had discovered that the published study summary did not match the raw records: three observations were) Tj T* (missing and a baseline had been changed. He planned to report the discrepancy to the institute\222s ethics board. Before) Tj T* (the review, the archive index was modified, a backup copy disappeared, and a suspicious account trail appeared to) Tj T* (implicate a junior analyst.) Tj T* ET
Q
