.133333 .133333 .133333 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 43 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (Teams act as independent digital investigators. Round 1 tests technical reasoning and provides the key to the case) Tj T* (room. Round 2 presents ten suspect profiles and a set of linked records. Teams must reconstruct the timeline,) Tj T* (distinguish reliable evidence from false leads, establish motive and opportunity, and decode a message that explains) Tj T* (why Dr. John was targeted.) Tj T* ET
